    <h2>Hire</h2>
    <p>Book a collection when you're finished. If you return equipment before the end of time paid in advance, we refund full weeks only.</p>
    <h2>New equipment</h2>
    <p>Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. If an item is faulty, call us and we'll arrange a repair, replacement or refund as required by law. We don't buy back stock.</p>
    <h2>Ex-hire equipment</h2>
    <p>Ex-hire equipment that is purchased cannot be returned, refunded or exchanged and does not come with a warranty.</p>
